  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family Planning by Choice in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver &apos;family planning for everyone who wants it&#x2019; in all of Ethiopia by: (a) improving the availability of modern family planning services at primary health care units ; (b) reducing regional disparities in the access to and voluntary use of modern family planning services; and (c) improving capacity of, and domestic financing for the Ethiopian health service delivery system for providing comprehensive family planning services.</narrative>
  </description>
